  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "- SDK3 World\nSteps:\n1. Create new graph\n2. add a bool variable, default to false\n3. Ctrl + drag 3 or 4 Set nodes for that bool, all default values should be false\n4. add any event node\n5. change the default value of any one Set node to True\n6. connect event node to any Set node\n7. delete that new noodle\nexpected: noodle disconnects, all default values are unaffected\nactual: all default values for that bool become True\nvideo: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V_b3pa2ipQc",
